Compute bias for each dataset and display the extremes


Show the code
filah_edges_bias &lt;- filah_edges_cleaned
trout_edges_bias &lt;- trout_edges_cleaned


filah_bias &lt;- compute_bias(filah_nodes_cleaned, filah_edges_bias)
trout_bias &lt;- compute_bias(trout_nodes_cleaned, trout_edges_bias)


filah_bias %&gt;%
  slice_max(order_by = bias_avg, n = 5) %&gt;% 
  print()


